<title>USA: K-III names new CEO of PJS Publications.</title>
<headline>K-III names new CEO of PJS Publications.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>K-III Communications Corp Monday promoted Steven Elzy to president and chief executive officer of its PJS Publications division.</p>
<p>Elzy, 34, a former vice president of operations of K-III Media, replaces Brian Beckwith, who became special assistant to K-III's chairman William Reilly.</p>
<p>Elzy will be responsible for the division's 19 magazines including Sail, Power &amp; Motoryacht; Crafts; Dog World; Horticulture; and Shooting Times.</p>
